Course Title
Robotic Process Automation (RPA) for Organizations

Catalog Description
The integration of Robotic Process Automation (RPA) into business operations is a growing trend that is revolutionizing 
the way organizations handle repetitive and time-consuming tasks. This course introduces students to the fundamentals of
Robotic Process Automation (RPA) technologies and how RPA can leverage Artificial Intelligence (AI) and Machine Learning (ML)
to assist an organization’s digital transformation efforts. Students will use hands-on exercises to understand how individuals
without programming experience can build RPA applications to improve productivity. Students will use relevant readings and 
case studies to explore the potential and pitfalls of RPA.
